{"id":"54053d8b82e7c72c","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-filtration.md","title":"Filtration","display":"df-filtration — Filtration","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-filtration","aliases":["58-df-filtration"],"display":"df-filtration — Filtration","depends_on":["[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-filtration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-filtration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-filtration — Filtration"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"58-df-sigma-algebra\">58-df-sigma-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (sigma-代数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"58-df-sigma-algebra\">58-df-sigma-algebra</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (函数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filtration}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Filtration}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (本文件定义的离散时间 filtration 谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}filtration} \\vdash \\mathrm{Filtration}_S(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\Omega)))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet(n),\\Omega)\\land\\mathcal F_\\bullet(n)\\subseteq\\mathcal F_\\bullet(n+1)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}filtration} \\vdash \\mathrm{Filtration}_S(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\Omega)))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet(n),\\Omega)\\land\\mathcal F_\\bullet(n)\\subseteq\\mathcal F_\\bullet(n+1)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Filtrations model increasing information over time.</li>\n<li>每一层现在都被约束为同一载体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 上的 sigma-代数。</li>\n<li>The natural filtration of a process captures its history.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-sigma-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sigma-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2$ (sigma-代数谓词, see [[58-df-sigma-algebra]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (函数谓词, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filtration}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}filtration} \\vdash \\mathrm{Filtration}_S(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\Omega)))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet(n),\\Omega)\\land\\mathcal F_\\bullet(n)\\subseteq\\mathcal F_\\bullet(n+1)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false}],"bytes":1170,"backlinks":[{"id":"51dcf9111a1a952a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Filtration}_S\\subseteq V^2$（离散时间滤过谓词，见 [[../batch18/58-df-filtration.md]]）"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-524","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-filtration.md|58-df-filtration]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a740bdad87b97ac6","36d7463d215be751"]}